ion><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/TibciaEPD7EmCnurpRziaicPogI1BC6hrVs6GrdA6BLLjKywuVibqzuF6x2B4uY3IV8huwdtyicgvGe9OjxJKia6Cvp4w7EjltAa3CyPdLaHBPYfBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/TibciaEPD7EmCnurpRziaicPogI1BC6hrVs6GrdA6BLLjKywuVibqzuF6x2B4uY3IV8huwdtyicgvGe9OjxJKia6Cvp4w7EjltAa3CyPdLaHBPYfBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/TibciaEPD7EmCnurpRziaicPogI1BC6hrVs6GrdA6BLLjKywuVibqzuF6x2B4uY3IV8huwdtyicgvGe9OjxJKia6Cvp4w7EjltAa3CyPdLaHBPYfBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/TibciaEPD7EmCnurpRziaicPogI1BC6hrVs6GrdA6BLLjKywuVibqzuF6x2B4uY3IV8huwdtyicgvGe9OjxJKia6Cvp4w7EjltAa3CyPdLaHBPYfBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>前言</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>根据《华东政法大学2027年招收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生办法》，经文伯书院讨论，制定本实施细则。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>组织管理　</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>文伯书院研究生招生工作小组负责组织和协调本院法治文化专业的推免生复试工作，并成立推免生复试工作小组，负责组织开展复试工作。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名申请</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6A97lla7YvrdELic577wMbamLWn5usFSnlUCYpxiaMJjK4bhicgn8NgcblrN8FibyftBWF7ic8wtoOziaPYX7ONPj5DLFozr8W5NK3V3FBRGn56ec/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）申请条件：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、思想品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，具备作为硕士研究生培养的能力和素质；</span></p><p><span>2、获得国内高等院校推荐免试生资格的优秀应届本科生（以教育部推免系统确定的推免资格为准）；</span></p><p><span>3、考生外语水平需通过国家大学英语六级考试（CET6成绩不低于425分），考生参加托福、雅思等世界公认的外语水平测试取得相应考试等级（托福成绩不低于85分，雅思成绩不低于6分），视为通过外语水平资格审核。申请人为其它语种的（日语、俄语、德语）必须取得相应语种同等水平的合格证书，具体参见《各类外语等级考试水平与大学生公共外语等级考试各语种六级合格水平对照表》。</span></p><p><span>4、具备以下条件之一者，在其它条件相近的情况下优先考虑接收：</span></p><p><span>（1）在本科学习期间获得相关专业的具有学术意义的省级以上学科竞赛奖项，并且是个人奖项或集体奖项的主要完成者；</span></p><p><span>（2）在国内外公开出版物上发表过与所读的本科专业或报读的研究生专业有关的、有一定水平的学术论文，并且是独立执笔者或第一、二作者；</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6A97lla7YvrdELic577wMbamLWn5usFSnlUCYpxiaMJjK4bhicgn8NgcblrN8FibyftBWF7ic8wtoOziaPYX7ONPj5DLFozr8W5NK3V3FBRGn56ec/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）预报名和材料提交：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、预报名：</span></strong></p><p><span>凡符合条件的申请者可登录华东政法大学研究生招生系统</span><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>https://yz.ecupl.edu.cn/#/homeIndex）</span></strong><span><span>进行推免生预报名，登录后选择“普通推免”项目填写相关信息。每人只能填报一个申请志愿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>我校2027年接收校内外推荐免试研究生系统的开放时间拟定为</span><strong><span>2026年9月9日（周三）12时至9月15日（周二）12时。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2、材料提交</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>申请人应按要求通过系统上传以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）本科阶段1－6学期成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）大学英语六级考试成绩单（其它语种提交相应水平证书）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）大学学习期间获得的各类奖励证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）与法治文化专业相关的学术论文、出版物或科研成果等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）申请“退役大学生士兵专项计划”的《入伍批准书》《退出现役证》。        </span></span></p><p><span><span>材料上传的截止日期为9月15日12时，未按要求上传上述材料者，其网上申请无效。申请人在网上提交的信息必须准确、有效，凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，将取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3、选拔办法</span></span></strong></p><p><span>（1）若错过我校预报名的推免生，仍可在中国研究生招生信息网“推免服务系统”中进行报名，我院将根据情况确定是否再次组织复试，届时请留意网站通知。</span></p><p><span>（2）申请者应提供真实、准确的材料，被我校录取的推免生名单将公示，如有弄虚作假，取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（3）拟录取推免生以中国研究生招生信息网“推免服务系统”中接受“待录取通知”为准，已接受我校待录取通知的推免生，不予接受解锁申请。</span></p><p><span>（4）若教育部、学校有新文件精神，相关政策按新文件精神执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>复试安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> 初审及复试安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>文伯书院对申请者材料进行初审，审核申请信息和安排复试，择优选拔，额满为止。确定复试名单后，通知初审合格的申请者参加复试。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>采取现场面试</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>面试地点：</span></span></p><p><span><span>华东政法大学松江校区 弘毅楼东203</span></span><span><span>室</span></span></p><p><span><span>面试时间：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年9月18日（周五）下午13时30分</span></span></p><p><span><span>将以短信/电话/邮件方式通知申请者具体的复试相关安排信息。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>复试内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>复试内容包括：外语能力测试；专业知识和综合能力测试、思想政治素质和道德品质；心理健康和人文素养等。复试过程全程录音录像可追溯。</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>（一）研究生招生办公室联系方式</span></p><p><span>通讯地址：上海市万航渡路1575号17楼106室</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：021-62071885</span></p><p><span>（二）文伯书院联系方式</span></p><p><span>电话：021-57090524</span></p><p><span>通讯地址：上海市松江区龙源路555号弘毅楼南214办公室</span></p><p><span>联系人：朱老师</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>-END-</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>编辑 | 陈思琪</span></p><p><span>源 | 华东政法大学 文伯书院</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/77k02j32nu62vRyRNbLMDaicQGUHK8l5NLN1DUjFEiaTPDvl5y4v7gNg0x6VQLeUdeMNaFTIeDRV8KdZoRXdHRLp8fKrvK4xCc48B8D9YJdac/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d07b38b0ed6ec62503308c3705ca46247f53598cc218f5807206aa736e557d73","textLength":1545,"sourceSha256":"16da7ad7128c209ca6c1f31c716bb6a224b1b9a3b36606e379b98162f0bef38d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e167c495613094f3cf12","title":"2026年华东政法大学文伯书院2027年招收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:35.636024+00:00"}
